.TH "JSONKIT\-STATS\-DEPTH\-MAX" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-stats\-depth\-max \- Print the deepest nesting level under a path.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit stats depth max\fR [path] [options]
.fi
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
\fIpath\fR
Dot path to measure. Omit it for the root.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-file\fR <\fIpath\fR>
The document to read. Omit it to read piped text.  (file or piped stdin, \- selects stdin; required)
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.nf
\fB$ jsonkit stats depth max user \-f doc.json\fR
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1), \fBjsonkit\-stats\-depth\fR(1)
